{"step_index":842,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T18:16:46Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Completely eradicated all mock/demo test data (Joseph Adona, Maria Gonzalez, David Sterling), removed all automatic mock seeding on startup/OCR fallback, added Clear All Pipeline Data wipe button, and deployed live to Surge.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Complete Eradication of Test/Demo Data & Clean Deployment\n\nAll mock and test data have been removed from the application:\n\n---\n\n## 1. Summary of Changes:\n- **Zero Mock Seeding:**\n  - Removed `sampleLeads` (Joseph Adona, Maria Gonzalez, David Sterling) from `database.ts` initialization.\n  - The local database now strictly contains system tables, SMS templates, and cadence rules—no contacts are inserted automatically.\n- **Removed OCR Demo Fallback:**\n  - In `visionService.ts`, removed `getDemoExtractedLeads()`. Real camera scans parse actual photos; if an unreadable image is uploaded, it reports the real parsing result rather than injecting fake teacher contacts.\n- **Settings Screen Wipe Tool:**\n  - Replaced developer demo buttons with a 1-tap **\"Wipe All Leads & Start Fresh\"** button in **Settings $\\rightarrow$ Data Management** to wipe any previously cached test data from local storage.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Live Surge Deployment:\n- URL: **`https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`**\n","Description":"Walkthrough documenting complete eradication of demo data and Surge deployment","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough for eradication of test data","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md with test data removal details"}}]}
