{"step_index":844,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T18:16:50Z","content":"**All mock, test, and demo data (Joseph Adona, Maria Gonzalez, David Sterling) have been permanently eradicated from the app.**\n\n---\n\n### What Was Found & Removed:\n\n1. **Database Initialization Seeder (`database.ts`):**\n   - Removed the automated seed routine that inserted sample leads whenever the database initialized. The database now initializes **100% clean and empty**.\n2. **OCR Fallback Mock Generator (`visionService.ts`):**\n   - Removed `getDemoExtractedLeads()` and the fallback condition in unstructured text parsing that was returning sample profiles.\n3. **Settings Screen Wipe Tool (`SettingsScreen.tsx`):**\n   - Removed developer demo seeding tools.\n   - Added a red **\"Wipe All Leads & Start Fresh\"** button in **Settings $\\rightarrow$ Data Management** that clears any leftover historical test leads from your phone's browser cache.\n\n---\n\n### Live Surge Deployment (Updated & Live):\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\n\n---\n\n### Recommended Quick Step on Your Phone:\n1. Open **SnapDialer** on your iPhone.\n2. Tap the **Settings ⚙️** icon in the top right.\n3. Scroll down and tap **\"Wipe All Leads & Start Fresh\"** (this clears any previously cached mock contacts).\n4. Return to your home screen—it will be completely clean, ready for you to snap your real ValuTeachers Report Cards!"}
